    "MissionGiver": "United Wayfarers Club",
    "Title": "CRITICAL REFUEL REQUEST: ~mission(Ship)",
    "TitleKey": "UWC_Refueling_high_title_001",
    "DisplayTitle": "CRITICAL REFUEL REQUEST: [Ship]",
    "Description": "Hi,\n\nAnother day another beacon. There's a <EM4>~mission(Ship)</EM4> looking to be topped up with ~mission(FuelType) at <EM4>~mission(Location|Address)</EM4>.  The client vessel will pay you at the rate of ~mission(RefuelRequest), and as a United Wayfarers Club contractor, you will also qualify for the UWC service fee listed above upon completion.\n\nI can't lie: it's a nasty place to get stuck and a worse place to get caught by surprise. We've lost good people out there - even the ones who got lucky made it home with pieces missing.\n\nIf you decide to take the job, do me a favor and keep everything peeled. If you've got a buddy with time to spare, maybe reach out for a little back-up.\n\nMaybe I'm being paranoid, but that doesn't mean they're not out to get you, as Momma Deloit used to say. \n\nActually she never said that - but I'm pretty sure she would if she did this for a living.\n\nJust do the job and get home safe, okay?\n\nDina Deloit\nDispatch Hub\nUnited Wayfarers Club\n\"We\u2019ve got your back\"",
    "DescriptionKey": "UWC_Refueling_high_desc_001",
    "DisplayDescription": "Hi,\n\nAnother day another beacon. There's a <EM4>[Ship]</EM4> looking to be topped up with <EM4>[HydrogenFuel] SCU of Hydrogen and [QTFuel] SCU of Quantum Fuel</EM4> at <EM4>Asteroid Mining Base</EM4>.  The client vessel will pay you at the rate of <EM4>[FuelRate] aUEC per SCU of Hydrogen</EM4> and  <EM4>[QTFuelRate] aUEC per SCU of Quantum</EM4>, and as a United Wayfarers Club contractor, you will also qualify for the UWC service fee listed above upon completion.\n\nI can't lie: it's a nasty place to get stuck and a worse place to get caught by surprise. We've lost good people out there - even the ones who got lucky made it home with pieces missing.\n\nIf you decide to take the job, do me a favor and keep everything peeled. If you've got a buddy with time to spare, maybe reach out for a little back-up.\n\nMaybe I'm being paranoid, but that doesn't mean they're not out to get you, as Momma Deloit used to say. \n\nActually she never said that - but I'm pretty sure she would if she did this for a living.\n\nJust do the job and get home safe, okay?\n\nDina Deloit\nDispatch Hub\nUnited Wayfarers Club\n\"We\u2019ve got your back\"",
